sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller (REST or Java)
    participant M as ResourceMonitor (@Around)
    participant S as ResourceServiceImpl (@Transactional)
    participant V as ResourceSchemaValidator
    participant I as IndexMapper (JSONPath / XPath)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant L as Listeners (VersionMonitor, ResourceChunkIndexService, Elastic, JMS)
    C->>M: addResource(resource)
    M->>S: proceed()
    S->>V: validate payload (JSON Schema / XSD)
    S->>I: extract index fields
    S->>DB: insert Resource + IndexedFields
    S-->>M: saved resource
    loop each ResourceListener
        M->>L: resourceAdded(resource)
        Note over M,L: exceptions are logged, not rethrown
    end
    M-->>C: resource
